            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Critical care illness is often followed by protracted, slow and incomplete recovery. Survivors given access to specialized rehabilitation achieve a higher level of recovery, with greater independence and less need for social or health-care support long-term.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
